{"parentUuid":"3bb26af6-a17f-41b6-baaf-a95d314e9218","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6f37bbaf-3b2a-4889-9da8-014105b65b82","agentId":"a0a1880745aab67e3","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012K2DGeLre9jgrYN5jCNty1","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Amazon warehouse layout optimization case study OR-Tools CP-SAT\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Amazon: A Case Study in How Strategic Warehouse Placement Can Drastically Reduce Shipping Times - Facilities Management Advisor\",\"url\":\"https://facilitiesmanagementadvisor.com/design-and-construction/amazon-a-case-study-in-how-strategic-warehouse-placement-can-drastically-reduce-shipping-times/\"},{\"title\":\"How Amazon Optimized Its Warehouse Operations | Education\",\"url\":\"https://vocal.media/education/how-amazon-optimized-its-warehouse-operations\"},{\"title\":\"Case-study analysis of warehouse process optimization - ScienceDirect\",\"url\":\"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S2352146522006408\"},{\"title\":\"Case Study: Amazon’s AI-Driven Supply Chain: A Blueprint for the Future of Global Logistics - The CDO TIMES\",\"url\":\"https://cdotimes.com/2024/08/23/case-study-amazons-ai-driven-supply-chain-a-blueprint-for-the-future-of-global-logistics/\"},{\"title\":\"AWS Simulation and Digital Twin to increase warehouse productivity | Amazon Supply Chain and Logistics\",\"url\":\"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/supply-chain/aws-simulation-and-digital-twin-to-increase-warehouse-productivity/\"},{\"title\":\"[Solved] Case Study: Amazon's Use of Technology in Supply Chain Management Overview: Amazon, the multinational e-commerce... | CliffsNotes\",\"url\":\"https://www.cliffsnotes.com/tutors-problems/Supply-Chain-Management/51482295-Case-Study-Amazons-Use-of-Technology-in-Supply-Chain-Management/\"},{\"title\":\"Amazon’s Operations Management: 10 Decisions, Productivity - Panmore\",\"url\":\"https://panmore.com/amazon-com-inc-operations-management-10-decisions-areas-productivity\"},{\"title\":\"Maximizing Operational Efficiency in Amazon Warehouse Operations - CliffsNotes\",\"url\":\"https://www.cliffsnotes.com/study-notes/19171097\"},{\"title\":\"Case studies of successful warehouse layout optimizations.\",\"url\":\"https://eoxs.com/new_blog/case-studies-of-successful-warehouse-layout-optimizations/\"},{\"title\":\"Amazon's Super-Efficient Warehouses\",\"url\":\"https://www.palletmarketinc.com/blog/how-amazon-makes-their-warehouses-hyper-efficient\"}]\n\nI've found information about Amazon's warehouse layout optimization, though the search results don't contain specific information about Google's OR-Tools CP-SAT solver being applied to Amazon's warehouse layouts. Here's what I found:\n\n## Amazon's Warehouse Layout Optimization Approach\n\nAmazon uses Robotic Process Automation (RPA) with robots equipped with AI algorithms to manage the movement of goods within warehouses, optimizing the layout and retrieval processes.\n\nAmazon leverages machine learning algorithms to optimize pick paths, reducing the time and distance traveled by workers during the order fulfillment process by analyzing data on product locations, order frequency, and picker performance to dynamically generate the most efficient pick paths.\n\nAmazon's approach includes using LIDAR scanners to capture accurate 3D images of current warehouse layouts. These assets can be repositioned to review and test different design ideas and optimize layout options.\n\nAmazon also uses a random stowage strategy that utilizes warehouse space more efficiently and allows them to split incoming shipments into individual pieces and stow products in multiple locations throughout the warehouse.\n\nUnfortunately, the search results don't contain any case studies specifically discussing Amazon's use of Google's OR-Tools CP-SAT solver for warehouse layout optimization. If you're looking for information about constraint programming applications in warehouse optimization, you may need to search for academic papers or Google OR-Tools documentation separately.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"c78da049-2477-4a7a-beab-7fb2924a3c40","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:00:40.501Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"3bb26af6-a17f-41b6-baaf-a95d314e9218","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"97420c21-31d9-4810-8160-91fd4df7e315","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6f37bbaf-3b2a-4889-9da8-014105b65b82","agentId":"a0a1880745aab67e3","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MfPmNge2GfXb2vmqca6SsK","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Hexaly success stories warehouse layout packing manufacturing 2024 2025\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Why Renault chose Hexaly to solve its packaging logistics optimization problem\",\"url\":\"https://www.hexaly.com/customers/renault-packaging-logistics-optimization\"},{\"title\":\"Warehouse Layout Trends for 2024 | EOXS\",\"url\":\"https://eoxs.com/new_blog/warehouse-layout-trends-for-2024/\"},{\"title\":\"Top 5 Trends Driving Warehouse Automation in Retail ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.honeywell.com/us/en/news/featured-stories/2025/04/top-5-trends-warehouse-automation-retail-distribution-2025\"},{\"title\":\"Research Report: 2024 Warehouse Outlook & Trends - Modern Materials Handling\",\"url\":\"https://www.mmh.com/article/research_report_2024_warehouse_outlook_trends\"},{\"title\":\"16 Warehouse Automation Trends for 2024\",\"url\":\"https://www.cyngn.com/blog/16-warehouse-automation-trends-for-2024\"},{\"title\":\"2024 Supply Chain Trends and Predictions: Preparing Warehouse Operations for the Future\",\"url\":\"https://blog.unex.com/2024-supply-chain-trends-and-predictions-preparing-your-warehouse-operations-for-the-future\"},{\"title\":\"7 Essential Warehousing Trends for 2025: A Strategic Guide | Pallite Group\",\"url\":\"https://pallitegroup.com/us/news/essential-warehousing-trends/\"},{\"title\":\"Predicting the Top 6 Warehouse Management Trends for 2024 | Manufacturing.net\",\"url\":\"https://www.manufacturing.net/supply-chain/blog/22883956/predicting-the-top-6-warehouse-management-trends-for-2024\"},{\"title\":\"The Essentials of Warehouse Design and Layout Consulting\",\"url\":\"https://www.warehousingandfulfillment.com/warehousing-and-fulfillment-resources/the-essentials-of-warehouse-design-and-layout-consulting/\"},{\"title\":\"5 Emerging Tech Trends Revolutionizing Warehouse Operations in 2024 | Supply Chain Connect\",\"url\":\"https://www.supplychainconnect.com/supply-chain-technology/article/55055082/5-emerging-tech-trends-revolutionizing-warehouse-operations-in-2024\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found regarding Hexaly success stories related to warehouse layout, packing, and manufacturing:\n\n## Hexaly Success Story: Renault\n\nRenault Group is a French multinational automobile manufacturer and one of the largest automakers in the world, and the Renault OR team has been using Hexaly to solve many problems since 2016.\n\n### The Problem\nThe most frequently encountered issues are related to Supply Chain Management, which includes production scheduling, transportation optimization, network design, truck item packing, workshop layout optimization, etc. Specifically, empty packaging management represents several million euros per year in terms of transportation and renewal costs.\n\n### The Solution\nReturn flows of empty packaging are now operated by the Packaging Management System (PMS), a custom software solution developed by Renault and based on Hexaly as an optimization engine.\n\n### Results and Recognition\nAfter a benchmark against IBM ILOG CPLEX, Renault's Operations Research team chose Hexaly to solve this packaging logistics optimization problem. The innovative primal heuristics inside Hexaly, combined with state-of-the-art exact methods, delivered proven near-optimal solutions in minutes of running times.\n\nThis case study demonstrates Hexaly's capability in solving complex supply chain optimization challenges in manufacturing and logistics contexts.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"47844b17-288d-4a58-96f0-498ccd900eda","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:00:40.866Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"97420c21-31d9-4810-8160-91fd4df7e315","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"a7f30d7f-951f-4f2a-8f2d-94fe6dcc63bc","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6f37bbaf-3b2a-4889-9da8-014105b65b82","agentId":"a0a1880745aab67e3","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0175LQSfyP6b91UZFEitMqNZ","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"\"IBM CP Optimizer\" semiconductor fab manufacturing layout case study industrial\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Transforming semiconductor manufacturing with intelligent Asset Lifecycle Management and ESG strategies\",\"url\":\"https://www.ibm.com/new/product-blog/semiconductor-manufacturing-with-intelligent-alm\"},{\"title\":\"How IBM invented semiconductor manufacturing automation - IEEE Spectrum\",\"url\":\"https://spectrum.ieee.org/semiconductor-fabrication\"},{\"title\":\"Semiconductors Case Studies on Supply Bottlenecks Management\",\"url\":\"https://decisionbrain.com/3-case-studies-semiconductor-industry/\"},{\"title\":\"IBM Chips In To Drive 2 Nanometer Semiconductor Manufacturing\",\"url\":\"https://www.nextplatform.com/2021/05/06/ibm-chips-in-to-drive-2-nanometer-semiconductor-manufacturing/\"},{\"title\":\"IBM ILOG CPLEX Optimization Studio\",\"url\":\"https://www.ibm.com/products/ilog-cplex-optimization-studio\"},{\"title\":\"Semiconductors - IBM Research\",\"url\":\"https://research.ibm.com/semiconductors\"},{\"title\":\"Building quantum computers with advanced semiconductor fab | IBM Quantum Computing Blog\",\"url\":\"https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/300mm-fab\"},{\"title\":\"Semiconductor Assembly and Test Services | IBM\",\"url\":\"https://www.ibm.com/services/semiconductor-assembly-test\"},{\"title\":\"Intelligent Fab - IBM Research\",\"url\":\"https://research.ibm.com/topics/intelligent-fab\"},{\"title\":\"IBM SiView Standard\",\"url\":\"https://www.ibm.com/products/siview\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found regarding IBM CP Optimizer and semiconductor fab manufacturing:\n\n## CP Optimizer in Semiconductor Manufacturing\n\nCP Optimizer is used to solve combinatorial models with discrete variables and tackle scheduling problems, making it ideal for resource planning, workforce scheduling, manufacturing optimization, packing, and assignment challenges across industries.\n\n## Case Study: IBM Bromont Assembly and Test Plant\n\nOne relevant industrial case study involves IBM's Bromont facility, an assembly and test plant that packages and tests silicon devices for external customers, with the responsibility of assembling 2000 new products every year using different products with 20-50 production steps, with a new production batch entering the assembly line about every three minutes.\n\n## Optimization Tools in Semiconductor Industry\n\nSpecialized industries like the semiconductor industry tend to use custom-built optimization solutions built on IBM CPLEX and constraint programming tools, which have been used for decades across industries to solve planning, scheduling, routing, and logistics optimization problems.\n\n## Intelligent Fab Development\n\nIBM is developing new data and AI tools to help semiconductor manufacturers harness the power of AI for competitive edge across planning, running, and streamlining fab operations, including AI applications for simulation and decision optimization, analytics and business insights.\n\nThe search results indicate that while IBM does offer CP Optimizer as part of its optimization suite, specific detailed case studies focused exclusively on fab layout optimization using CP Optimizer were not found in these results.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"172d5d5a-9e27-4b46-9e8a-38e069beaa89","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:00:43.607Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"a7f30d7f-951f-4f2a-8f2d-94fe6dcc63bc","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"d2dde9b8-eb21-4752-b165-8ac02b60438e","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6f37bbaf-3b2a-4889-9da8-014105b65b82","agentId":"a0a1880745aab67e3","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018oS9r9FBQasAAAbKKWzwGb","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"CPAIOR 2024 industrial application paper warm start Benders decomposition\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"CPAIOR 2024 - Call for Papers\",\"url\":\"https://sites.google.com/view/cpaior2024/call-for-papers\"},{\"title\":\"CPAIOR 2024 - Accepted Papers\",\"url\":\"https://sites.google.com/view/cpaior2024/accepted-papers\"},{\"title\":\"Accelerating Benders decomposition for short-term hydropower maintenance scheduling - ScienceDirect\",\"url\":\"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/abs/pii/S0377221720305841\"},{\"title\":\"Logic-Based Benders Decomposition | Springer Nature Link\",\"url\":\"https://link.springer.com/rwe/10.1007/978-3-030-54621-2_903-1\"},{\"title\":\"An accelerated benders decomposition algorithm for the solution of the multi-trip time-dependent vehicle routing problem with time windows\",\"url\":\"https://ideas.repec.org/a/eee/ejores/v317y2024i2p500-514.html\"},{\"title\":\"Single-facility scheduling by logic-based Benders decomposition | Annals of Operations Research | Springer Nature Link\",\"url\":\"https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s10479-011-1031-z\"},{\"title\":\"EUDML | Warm-start cuts for Generalized Benders Decomposition\",\"url\":\"https://eudml.org/doc/294377\"},{\"title\":\"Planning and Scheduling by Logic-Based Benders Decomposition | Operations Research\",\"url\":\"https://pubsonline.informs.org/doi/10.1287/opre.1060.0371\"},{\"title\":\"Regularized Benders Decomposition for High Performance Capacity Expansion Models\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/html/2403.02559v2\"},{\"title\":\"CPAIOR 2024\",\"url\":\"https://sites.google.com/view/cpaior2024\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found relevant information about CPAIOR 2024 and papers involving Benders decomposition. The 21st International Conference on the Integration of Constraint Programming, Artificial Intelligence, and Operations Research was held in Uppsala, Sweden, from May 28 to May 31, 2024.\n\nWhile the search results show innovative decomposition techniques including those based on Benders decomposition as a topic of interest for the conference, and there are several papers on Benders decomposition accepted at CPAIOR 2024, I found a few papers with Benders decomposition topics but the search results don't specifically identify a particular industrial application paper explicitly combining all three elements (warm start, Benders decomposition, and industrial application) from CPAIOR 2024.\n\nThe search results do show that one accepted paper at CPAIOR 2024 is \"ULD Build-Up Scheduling with Logic-Based Benders Decomposition\" by Ricardo Euler and colleagues, which appears to be an industrial application, though the specific mention of \"warm start\" techniques is not confirmed in these results.\n\nTo find the specific industrial application paper you're looking for that combines warm start with Benders decomposition at CPAIOR 2024, you might want to check the full accepted papers list on the CPAIOR 2024 website directly.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"c4fe6ee9-a176-4409-8e3f-561388909fce","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:00:44.913Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"d2dde9b8-eb21-4752-b165-8ac02b60438e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
