Bosch, Hyundai) from 2024-2025. The results show general Gurobi case studies and summits, but nothing matching the specific industrial applications and companies you're looking for.\n\nWould you like me to:\n1. Search more specifically for \"Gurobi chip floorplan placement\" or similar semiconductor-focused terms?\n2. Search for each company individually with Gurobi optimization?\n3. Look for chip design or floorplanning optimization case studies in general?\n\nLet me know how you'd like me to refine the search to find the information you're looking for.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"b5f74c2e-cb9e-4ad2-8dfb-5084f1bf9a05","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:01:22.506Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"9e852cec-d233-43d5-be1b-0db3b4036333","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"c9166599-941e-4311-838b-ca26f84fb0c7","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"c7a9c836-fcfa-483d-8466-444dc60bbf86","agentId":"a0a1880745aab67e3","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MGQ2CqanupwdW3fyjZYVc8","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"\"Walmart\" Edelman 2024 supply chain network optimization INFORMS solver scale\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Optimizing Walmart’s Supply Chain from Strategy to Execution\",\"url\":\"https://courses.ie.bilkent.edu.tr/ie479/wp-content/uploads/sites/16/2024/11/Optimizing-Walmarts-Supply-Chain-from-Strategy-to-Execution.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Optimizing Walmart’s Outbound Supply Chain from Strategy to Execution – A Grocery Case Study\",\"url\":\"https://www.informs.org/Impact/O.R.-Analytics-Success-Stories/Walmart-A-Grocery-Case-Study\"},{\"title\":\"Optimizing Walmart’s Supply Chain from Strategy to Execution | INFORMS Journal on Applied Analytics\",\"url\":\"https://pubsonline.informs.org/doi/10.1287/inte.2023.0093\"},{\"title\":\"Five Lessons from Walmart’s Strategic Network Design Talk for my Students\",\"url\":\"https://miketalksai.substack.com/p/five-lessons-from-walmarts-strategic\"},{\"title\":\"Walmart's $75M AI Win: Optimizing 11,000 Stores with Intelligent Routing | GreenData Ventures\",\"url\":\"https://greendata.io/insights/walmart-ai-supply-chain-optimization\"},{\"title\":\"2023 Edelman Award Winner Reprise: Walmart uses O.R. to enhance retail truck routing and load planning | Analytics Magazine News\",\"url\":\"https://pubsonline.informs.org/do/10.1287/LYTX.2023.02.17n/full/\"},{\"title\":\"McDonald’s China Adopts Operations Research for Network Design | INFORMS Journal on Applied Analytics\",\"url\":\"https://pubsonline.informs.org/doi/10.1287/inte.2024.0179\"},{\"title\":\"Operations Research Enhances Retail Truck Routing and Load Planning: Walmart Awarded the 2023 INFORMS Edelman Award - INFORMS\",\"url\":\"https://www.informs.org/News-Room/INFORMS-Releases/Awards-Releases/Operations-Research-Enhances-Retail-Truck-Routing-and-Load-Planning-Walmart-Awarded-the-2023-INFORMS-Edelman-Award\"},{\"title\":\"Optimizing Walmart’s Supply Chain from Strategy to Execution | Request PDF\",\"url\":\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/378065096_Optimizing_Walmart's_Supply_Chain_from_Strategy_to_Execution\"},{\"title\":\"Mehrotra Et Al 2024 Optimizing Walmart s Supply Chain ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.scribd.com/document/960759257/Mehrotra-Et-Al-2024-Optimizing-Walmart-s-Supply-Chain-From-Strategy-to-Execution\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found about Walmart's supply chain network optimization work that won the INFORMS Edelman Award:\n\n## Overview\n\nWalmart was awarded the 2023 Franz Edelman Award for its use of operations research to enhance retail truck routing and load planning. The work was published in the INFORMS Journal on Applied Analytics in 2024.\n\n## Key Achievements\n\nWalmart used advanced optimization models to build a transformation roadmap for long-term supply chain capital investments as well as an application supporting daily decisions of truck routing and loading. In fiscal year 2023, with the full network rollout of Load Planner, Walmart saved $91.5 million and prevented 98.6 million pounds of CO₂ emissions by avoiding 33 million miles and 108,000 truck routes.\n\n## Solution Approach\n\nThe team simultaneously solved routing and loading problems with rich operational constraints, as well as solved the variable-sized multicompartment container loading problem in a millisecond. Walmart takes a holistic approach to its supply chain, which integrates strategic and operational decisions consisting of network planning and transformation.\n\nThe work demonstrates successful implementation of advanced optimization at massive scale across Walmart's extensive distribution network.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"5867196f-2a5d-4135-88c4-db8515cafc14","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:01:22.981Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"c9166599-941e-4311-838b-ca26f84fb0c7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"1eb0e0c3-8144-46d1-9b5e-e4be44789a95","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"c7a9c836-fcfa-483d-8466-444dc60bbf86","agentId":"a0a1880745aab67e3","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CNkTiK4X8MN7P4kuqUhpgZ","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"\"anytime\" optimization industrial production decision MIP gap acceptance practice\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"What is the MIPGap? – Gurobi Help Center\",\"url\":\"https://support.gurobi.com/hc/en-us/articles/8265539575953-What-is-the-MIPGap\"},{\"title\":\"MIP Schedule Optimization\",\"url\":\"https://www.emergentmind.com/topics/mixed-integer-programming-mip-schedule-optimization\"},{\"title\":\"MIP Gap Parameter in MIP Solvers: Full How To Guide - The BlogSail\",\"url\":\"https://theblogsail.com/technology/optimization/mip-gap-parameter-in-mip-solvers-full-how-to-guide/\"},{\"title\":\"Interpretation of Optimality Gap | Decision Optimization\",\"url\":\"https://community.ibm.com/community/user/discussion/interpretation-of-optimality-gap\"},{\"title\":\"Production Decision Optimization Based on a Multi-Agent Mixed Integer Programming Model\",\"url\":\"https://www.mdpi.com/2227-7390/13/11/1827\"},{\"title\":\"Learning Optimal Solutions via an LSTM-Optimization Framework - PMC\",\"url\":\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10241613/\"},{\"title\":\"MILP performance improvement strategies for short-term batch production scheduling: a chemical industry use case | Discover Applied Sciences\",\"url\":\"https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s42452-022-04969-2\"},{\"title\":\"MIP-based heuristics for multi-item capacitated lot-sizing problem\",\"url\":\"https://optimization-online.org/wp-content/uploads/2005/11/1244.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"What is Mixed Integer Programming (MIP)? | NVIDIA Glossary\",\"url\":\"https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/glossary/mixed-integer-programming/\"},{\"title\":\"MIPGap - Gurobi Optimization\",\"url\":\"https://www.gurobi.com/documentation/9.1/refman/mipgap2.html\"}]\n\nI've performed a web search for \"anytime optimization industrial production decision MIP gap acceptance\" and found several highly relevant results. Here's what the search revealed:\n\n## Key Findings:\n\n**MIP Gap Acceptance in Practice:**\n\nFor real-world applications, it is sensible to set a positive MIP gap tolerance since achieving an exact zero gap is often time-consuming and resource-intensive, which is why solvers like Gurobi use a small, non-zero value for MIPGap to balance solution quality and solve time, providing near-optimal results without excessive computation.\n\n**Industrial Production Decision Making:**\n\nA recent study explores production decision optimization when enterprises have precise data on defect rates of spare parts and finished products, using a multi-agent mixed-integer programming model consisting of quality inspection and decision-making components.\n\n**Anytime Algorithm Concept:**\n\nThe MIP gap parameter acts as a termination criterion, signaling that further computational efforts may not significantly improve solution quality, and empowers users to control the trade-off between solution quality and computation time.\n\n**Practical Applications in Batch Production:**\n\nScheduling models in the process industry are typically realized through mixed-integer programming, though providing acceptable computational performance remains a challenge regarding practical application. In one study using machine learning for optimization, an average solution time of 70 CPU hours was reduced to only 2 CPU minutes with a 0.8% optimality gap.\n\nThe search results show that accepting non-zero MIP gaps is standard practice in industrial production optimization, allowing decision-makers to balance optimality with computational feasibility.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"94312689-ea5e-4bd4-b548-37e14cd1d29d","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:01:26.662Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"1eb0e0c3-8144-46d1-9b5e-e4be44789a95","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"0e55f74c-15f9-46d2-84e7-371afdd19568","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"c7a9c836-fcfa-483d-8466-444dc60bbf86","agentId":"a0a1880745aab67e3","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MMKvpCgPFMDMWoKg1wpfdB","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"\"Hexaly\" OR \"LocalSolver\" customer case study facility layout placement Air Liquide BNP\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Hexaly\",\"url\":\"https://www.hexaly.com/\"},{\"title\":\"Shape optimization through Simulation Optimization with LocalSolver - Hexaly\",\"url\":\"https://www.hexaly.com/tutorial/shape-optimization-through-simulation-optimization-with-localsolver?redirect\"},{\"title\":\"LocalSolver solves large-scale Inventory Routing Problems in minutes for Air Liquide - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=J4JpTtn6XNM\"},{\"title\":\"New release: LocalSolver 12.0\",\"url\":\"https://www.hexaly.com/announcement/new-release-localsolver-12-0\"},{\"title\":\"LocalSolver 7.0 — Hexaly 14.0 documentation\",\"url\":\"https://www.hexaly.com/docs/last/changelog/localsolver70.html\"},{\"title\":\"How Air Liquide solves inventory routing problems in minutes with Hexaly\",\"url\":\"https://www.hexaly.com/customers/air-liquide-inventory-routing\"},{\"title\":\"Solvers for Scheduling and Routing Problems |\",\"url\":\"https://dmcommunity.org/2024/04/16/localsolver-is-now-hexaly/\"},{\"title\":\"LocalSolver — Case Study - Air Liquide\",\"url\":\"https://www.localsolver.com/clientairliquide.html\"},{\"title\":\"New release: LocalSolver 10.0 - Hexaly\",\"url\":\"https://www.hexaly.com/announcement/localsolver-10-0\"},{\"title\":\"LocalSolver (LocalSolver 6.0 API)\",\"url\":\"https://www.hexaly.com/docs/6_0/java/localsolver/LocalSolver.html\"}]\n\nI found some relevant information about Hexaly/LocalSolver and an Air Liquide case study. Let me search for more specific information about facility layout and placement, as well as any BNP-related cases.\n\nNo links found.\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"LocalSolver (LocalSolver 8.0 API)\",\"url\":\"https://www.hexaly.com/docs/8_0/java/localsolver/LocalSolver.html?redirect\"},{\"title\":\"LocalSolver (LocalSolver 6.0 API)\",\"url\":\"https://www.hexaly.com/docs/6_0/java/localsolver/LocalSolver.html\"},{\"title\":\"Hexaly\",\"url\":\"https://www.hexaly.com/\"},{\"title\":\"Localsolver: localsolver.LocalSolver Class Reference\",\"url\":\"https://www.hexaly.com/docs/5_5/csharp/classlocalsolver_1_1_local_solver.html\"},{\"title\":\"Solvers for Scheduling and Routing Problems |\",\"url\":\"https://dmcommunity.org/2024/04/16/localsolver-is-now-hexaly/\"},{\"title\":\"LocalSolver 7.0 — Hexaly 14.0 documentation\",\"url\":\"https://www.hexaly.com/docs/last/changelog/localsolver70.html\"},{\"title\":\"LocalSolver (LocalSolver 12.5 API)\",\"url\":\"https://www.hexaly.com/docs/12_5/java/localsolver/LocalSolver.html\"},{\"title\":\"Hexaly 11.5\",\"url\":\"https://www.hexaly.com/announcements/new-release-localsolver-11-5\"},{\"title\":\"New release: LocalSolver 10.0 - Hexaly\",\"url\":\"https://www.hexaly.com/announcement/localsolver-10-0\"},{\"title\":\"Migrate from LocalSolver to Hexaly — Hexaly 14.5 documentation\",\"url\":\"https://www.hexaly.com/docs/last/changelog/migration.html\"}]\n\nBased on my web search results, I found relevant information about Hexaly/LocalSolver and customer case studies. Here's what I found:\n\n## Air Liquide Case Study\n\nAir Liquide is a French multinational company which supplies industrial gases and services to various industries, including medical, chemical, and electronic manufacturers. Founded in 1902, it is the second-largest supplier of industrial gases by revenues and has operations in over 80 countries.\n\nTo optimize and digitalize the bulk supply chain, Air Liquide developed an inventory routing software, namely Bulk Trip Assist (BTA), based on LocalSolver to plan more efficient deliveries of bulk cryogenic liquids to customers. The case study is available on the Hexaly website and focuses on inventory routing optimization rather than facility layout.\n\n## Facility Location Capabilities\n\nWhile I did not find a specific case study about facility layout placement optimization, the search results indicate that LocalSolver can solve capacitated facility location problems, achieving an average gap to best known solutions of 3.8% within 1 minute on networks with up to 1,500 customers.\n\n## Regarding BNP\n\nI was unable to locate a specific case study involving BNP (BNP Paribas or another BNP entity) using Hexaly or LocalSolver in the search results. The searches primarily returned the Air Liquide case study and technical documentation.\n\nIf you're looking for additional specific case studies, I recommend visiting the Hexaly website's customer case studies section directly, or contacting Hexaly for detailed customer success stories.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"de64122f-0c0f-4eca-911b-67cd0bf75dad","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:01:26.857Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"0e55f74c-15f9-46d2-84e7-371afdd19568","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
