{"parentUuid":"1f9b3e33-a852-467e-b393-33a27cae7e64","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"2ff5202a-4e67-4036-a6e3-b87208b2fc72","agentId":"a0a1880745aab67e3","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Xo9Rbzwunp5Dnsb94rXh7s","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"\"INFORMS Journal on Applied Analytics\" 2024 2025 large scale layout placement industrial Edelman Wagner\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"INFORMS Journal on Applied Analytics | PubsOnLine\",\"url\":\"https://pubsonline.informs.org/journal/ijaa\"},{\"title\":\"Special Issues | | INFORMS Journal on Applied Analytics\",\"url\":\"https://pubsonline.informs.org/page/inte/special-issues\"},{\"title\":\"Current Issue | INFORMS Journal on Applied Analytics\",\"url\":\"https://pubsonline.informs.org/toc/ijaa/current\"},{\"title\":\"INFORMS Journal on Applied Analytics - Wikipedia\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/INFORMS_Journal_on_Applied_Analytics\"},{\"title\":\"INFORMS Journal on Applied Analytics Editor’s Statement: The Critical Role of Applied Research in Analytics | INFORMS Journal on Applied Analytics\",\"url\":\"https://pubsonline.informs.org/doi/10.1287/inte.2020.1066\"},{\"title\":\"Introduction: 2024 Franz Edelman Award for Achievement in Advanced Analytics, Operations Research, and Management Science | INFORMS Journal on Applied Analytics\",\"url\":\"https://pubsonline.informs.org/doi/10.1287/inte.2024.intro.v55.n1\"},{\"title\":\"Introduction: 2024 Franz Edelman Award for Achievement in Advanced Analytics, Operations Research, and Management Science\",\"url\":\"https://ideas.repec.org/a/inm/orinte/v55y2025i1p1-4.html\"},{\"title\":\"INFORMS Journal on Applied Analytics | JSTOR\",\"url\":\"https://www.jstor.org/journal/infojapplanal\"},{\"title\":\"INFORMS Journals - INFORMS\",\"url\":\"https://www.informs.org/Publications/INFORMS-Journals\"},{\"title\":\"Editorial Statement | INFORMS Journal on Applied Analytics\",\"url\":\"https://pubsonline.informs.org/page/inte/editorial-statement\"}]\n\nI found information about the INFORMS Journal on Applied Analytics and the Franz Edelman Award and Daniel H. Wagner Prize featured in the journal. However, the search results don't contain a specific article about \"large scale layout placement\" by Edelman and Wagner in 2024-2025. Let me refine my search:\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Full article: A bottom-up multi-objective optimisation approach to dynamic facility layout planning\",\"url\":\"https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/full/10.1080/00207543.2023.2168308\"},{\"title\":\"From theory to application: investigating the generalizability of facility layout problems using a deep reinforcement learning approach | Production Engineering | Springer Nature Link\",\"url\":\"https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s11740-025-01352-z\"},{\"title\":\"New model for large scale chemical industrial layout optimization - ScienceDirect\",\"url\":\"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/abs/pii/S0263876220302914\"},{\"title\":\"Full article: Data-driven warehouse design: a decision tree approach with integrated mobile application\",\"url\":\"https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/full/10.1080/17509653.2025.2523262\"},{\"title\":\"Optimization of facility layout using reinforcement learning for semiconductor production | Journal of Computational Design and Engineering | Oxford Academic\",\"url\":\"https://academic.oup.com/jcde/article/13/1/174/8373815\"},{\"title\":\"Mathematical optimization approach for facility layout on several rows | Optimization Letters | Springer Nature Link\",\"url\":\"https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s11590-020-01621-z\"},{\"title\":\"A comprehensive review of static and dynamic facility layout problems - ScienceDirect\",\"url\":\"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S1367578824000397\"},{\"title\":\"Full article: Multi-objective optimisation of a logistics area in the context of factory layout planning\",\"url\":\"https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/full/10.1080/21693277.2024.2323484\"},{\"title\":\"A study of the layout planning of plant facility based on the timed Petri net and systematic layout planning | PLOS One\",\"url\":\"https://journals.plos.org/plosone/article?id=10.1371/journal.pone.0239685\"},{\"title\":\"Full article: Productivity improvement of a manufacturing facility using systematic layout planning\",\"url\":\"https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/full/10.1080/23311916.2016.1207296\"}]\n\nThe results are still not showing the specific article you're looking for. Let me try a more targeted search focusing on INFORMS, Edelman, and Wagner Prize publications:\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Simulation-Optimization for Resource Allocation at SF Express Hub | INFORMS Journal on Applied Analytics\",\"url\":\"https://pubsonline.informs.org/doi/10.1287/inte.2024.0187\"}]\n\nLet me search more specifically for articles that mention both Edelman and Wagner in connection with layout problems:\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Franz Edelman Award for Achievement in Advanced Analytics, Operations Research, and Management Science\",\"url\":\"https://www.informs.org/Recognizing-Excellence/INFORMS-Prizes/Franz-Edelman-Award\"},{\"title\":\"Franz Edelman Award for Achievement in Operations Research and the Management Sciences - Wikipedia\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Franz_Edelman_Award_for_Achievement_in_Operations_Research_and_the_Management_Sciences\"},{\"title\":\"INFORMS Prizes & Awards\",\"url\":\"https://www.informs.org/Recognizing-Excellence/INFORMS-Prizes\"},{\"title\":\"Daniel H. Wagner Prize for Excellence in the Practice of Advanced Analytics and Operations Research - INFORMS\",\"url\":\"https://www.informs.org/Recognizing-Excellence/INFORMS-Prizes/Daniel-H.-Wagner-Prize-for-Excellence-in-the-Practice-of-Advanced-Analytics-and-Operations-Research\"},{\"title\":\"News & Awards | Edelman\",\"url\":\"https://www.edelman.com/news-awards\"},{\"title\":\"Edelman Award - INFORMS\",\"url\":\"https://www.informs.org/Recognizing-Excellence/Edelman-Award\"},{\"title\":\"2021 2021 EDELMAN EDELMAN AWARD AWARD CEREMONY CEREMONY\",\"url\":\"https://tauber.umich.edu/sites/default/files/documents/2021_edelman_award_book.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Edelman Award and Wagner Prize Winners - Gurobi Optimization\",\"url\":\"https://www.gurobi.com/news/edelman-award-and-wagner-prize-winners/\"},{\"title\":\"2024 Franz Edelman Award finalist: American Airlines - Resoundingly Human\",\"url\":\"https://resoundinglyhuman.com/episodes/2024-franz-edelman-award-finalist-american-airlines/\"},{\"title\":\"Introduction: 2024 Franz Edelman Award for Achievement in Advanced Analytics, Operations Research, and Management Science\",\"url\":\"https://ideas.repec.org/a/inm/orinte/v55y2025i1p1-4.html\"}]\n\nBased on my search results, I found information about the INFORMS Journal on Applied Analytics and the awards it features. Here's what I discovered:\n\nThe INFORMS Journal on Applied Analytics is a bimonthly peer-reviewed academic journal about operations research that was established in 1970 under the title Interfaces, and the journal has a case-study style: it offers examples of how operations research theory has been applied in businesses and organizations.\n\nRegarding the Franz Edelman Award and Daniel H. Wagner Prize featured in this journal, IJAA is the home of some of the most recognized INFORMS awards, including the Edelman, Wagner, and Smith Awards.\n\nThis special issue of the INFORMS Journal on Applied Analytics (formerly Interfaces) is devoted to the finalists of the 2024 annual competition for the Franz Edelman Award for Achievement in Advanced Analytics, Operations Research, and Management Science, with the 2024 finalists published in Volume 55, Issue 1 (January-February 2025).\n\nHowever, I was unable to locate a specific article in the INFORMS Journal on Applied Analytics that matches your search query combining \"large scale layout placement\" with both Edelman and Wagner. If you're looking for a particular paper, you may want to check the journal's current issues directly at pubsonline.informs.org, or provide additional details about the article (such as the title or author names) that would help narrow down the search.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"5ef0d585-0f9b-4254-92c4-e838d3b26ea1","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:01:45.366Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"1f9b3e33-a852-467e-b393-33a27cae7e64","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"c6712940-6c84-46ad-a9fa-96be9b937340","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"38c07af1-20a0-4259-b86e-62f4b4b0ab0c","agentId":"a0a1880745aab67e3","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DYzPZFQBgt48PYrBEp9mon","type":"tool_result","content":"# Gurobi Case Studies Summary\n\nBased on the provided webpage, here are the Gurobi customer case studies listed:\n\n| Company | Industry | Problem Type | Scale/Outcome |\n|---------|----------|--------------|---------------|\n| Eneco | Energy | Portfolio dispatch optimization | Balances renewable energy resources |\n| Kurly | Logistics | Delivery route optimization | Enables morning deliveries across South Korea |\n| Hitit | Aviation | Crew leave planning | Reduces planning from weeks to hours |\n| Marketing Attribution | Consumer Health | Media spend allocation | Optimizes $1.4B+ annual ad budget across 160 countries |\n| MyGoals | Financial Planning | Multi-goal optimization | Balances personal financial objectives |\n| Light Up the World | Energy Access | Solar system design | Off-grid system design for remote communities |\n| 55ip | Investment Management | Portfolio optimization | Manages tax-smart accounts at scale |\n| Statkraft Croatia | Energy Storage | Battery profitability assessment | Maximizes battery storage revenue |\n| Cosentino | Manufacturing | Sales route & production planning | Optimizes commercial visits and production lines |\n| Quanta Technology | Utilities | Resilience planning | Reduces SAIDI/SAIFI metrics for cost savings |\n| Veltys | Retail/Apparel | Markdown pricing optimization | Increases gross margins through promotional planning |\n| Suzano | Supply Chain | Export logistics | Optimizes pulp exports to 100+ countries |\n| YOKU MOKU CREA | Food Manufacturing | Daily production planning | Manages 350 million confectionery pieces annually |\n| Luca | Grocery Retail | Price optimization | Optimizes tens of thousands of products in seconds |\n| C3 AI | Enterprise Software | Business process optimization | Embeds optimization in 90+ AI applications |\n| Posten Bring | Postal Services | Delivery district planning | Balances cost efficiency with service equity across Norway |\n| Lyft | Rideshare | Driver incentive optimization | Optimizes across millions of variables |\n| Polymathian | Mining | Supply chain visibility | Coordinates mine, rail, port, and marketing operations |\n| Sixt Portugal | Car Rental | Pricing and fleet management | Real-time optimization across 42 stations |\n| Instacart | Grocery Delivery | Order fulfillment optimization | Delivers groceries in under 45 minutes |\n| OneChronos | Financial Trading | Combinatorial auction design | Reduces trading inefficiencies |\n| Pharmaceuticals (unnamed) | Pharmaceuticals | Supply chain risk mitigation | Manages 21 global manufacturing sites |\n| Fonterra | Dairy | Daily product mix optimization | Manages 30% of global dairy exports |\n| KLM-BCG | Aviation | Five-year crew planning | Manages complex regulations and training requirements |\n| Metallurgical Additives Producer | Manufacturing | Resource allocation optimization | Saves estimated $1.5M annually |\n| Automation Intelligence | Manufacturing/Warehouse | Efficiency optimization | Boosts efficiency by 5%+ without hardware changes |\n| Audi | Automotive Logistics | Logistics problem solving | Solves complex problems in seconds |\n| J-POWER | Energy | Renewable energy planning | Simulates future supply/demand scenarios for Japan |\n| Decide4AI | Retail/Energy | Multi-sector optimization | Delivers efficiency gains across sectors |\n| SESCO | Energy Trading | Portfolio simulation and optimization | Trades energy portfolios in deregulated U.S. markets |\n| Workforce Analytics | Human Resources | Workforce rostering | Improves compliance and customer service outcomes |\n| Water Corporation | Water Management | Resource allocation | Manages scarce resources amid climate stress |\n| Yverdon-les-Bains | Urban Planning | Energy neighborhood design | Designs net-zero energy district for 3,800 residents |\n| ESUPS | Humanitarian | Emergency supply positioning | Pre-positions disaster relief supplies globally |\n| Princeton Consultants | Government | Census resource optimization | Saved $2.8 billion in 2020 U.S. census spending |\n| Optimeering Aqua | Aquaculture | Harvest and stocking decisions | Maximizes fish farming yield |\n| PATH | Healthcare Logistics | Medical equipment routing | Routes life-saving oxygen equipment globally |\n| SAP | Enterprise Software | Supply chain scenario planning | Integrates optimization across cloud portfolio |\n| Inmarsat | Telecommunications | Radio spectrum management | Manages satellite capacity and spectrum |\n| Avista | Utilities | Utility planning optimization | Solves complex problems in seconds |\n| Decision Lab/Dstl | Military Logistics | Equipment packing and routing | Reduces transport waste in high-stakes logistics |\n| Water Resources South East | Water Planning | Investment planning optimization | Plans water supply investments for England |\n| National Institute for Environmental Studies | Climate/Energy | CO2 emissions pathway modeling | Models 80% emissions reduction by 2050 |\n| NordStar | Aviation | Crew planning optimization | Improves operational efficiency |\n| Ogimoto Laboratory | Energy | Power supply/demand balancing | Stabilizes Japan's power grid |\n| Pentair Water Solutions | Manufacturing | Production scheduling | Optimizes 1,300 complex metal casting molds |\n| Polymathian (Mining variant) | Mining | Supply chain throughput maximization | Moves material from pit to vessel at lowest cost |\n| Polymathian (Utility variant) | Utilities | Multi-energy asset dispatch | Optimizes real-time market dispatch |\n| Polymathian (Crew variant) | Rail/Logistics | Crew allocation and scheduling | Improves bulk rail operator efficiency |\n| Portland Public Schools | Education | Student redistricting optimization | Balances fairness, class sizes, and travel distance |\n| RITE Institute | Energy Research | Technology evaluation and CO2 planning | Plans cost-effective emissions reduction pathways |\n| Robeco | Investment Management | Fixed-income portfolio automation | Automates portfolio management for better returns |\n| RWTH Aachen University | Energy/Education | Multi-energy system design | Designs optimal district energy systems; trains 1,500+ students annually |\n| Swissport | Airport Operations | Staff scheduling automation | Automates schedules for 2,000 staff at Zurich Airport |\n| SwissQuant | Private Banking | Portfolio optimization | Generates optimal portfolios in seconds |\n| Tata Steel | Steel Manufacturing | Coal blending optimization | Projected to save millions long-term |\n| The Energy Authority | Hydropower | Water routing optimization | Routes water through six Columbia River dams |\n| Tokyo Metropolitan University | Water Management | Energy minimization for water supply | Reduces energy use in water distribution |\n| Tokyo University | Logistics/Education | Network redesign and disaster recovery | Redesigns logistics networks post-disaster |\n| Toyota | Automotive Manufacturing | Daily production planning | Balances environmental regulations globally |\n| Uber | Aviation Technology | Urban air mobility network design | Designs skyport networks and eVTOL routing |\n| Vidale Consulting | Mining | Mining model development | Builds optimization models rapidly |\n| Wincor Nixdorf | Cash Management | ATM cash supply optimization | Controls ATM cash across 130+ countries |\n| Yutong Bus | Bus Manufacturing | Daily production allocation | Allocates 170+ daily orders across 10 production lines |\n| Alpiq | Hydropower | Plant scheduling optimization | Optimizes European hydroelectric scheduling |\n| Arauco | Forest Products | Supply chain balancing | Balances supply/demand across global wood network |\n| Arute Solutions | Banking | ATM visit schedule optimization | Minimizes idle cash and operating costs |\n| German Basketball League | Sports | Game scheduling optimization | Schedules 306 games across 18 teams |\n| Birchbox | E-commerce | Subscription matching optimization | Matches beauty samples to subscriber profiles |\n| Blue Yonder | Retail | Retail price optimization | AI-powered pricing for global retailers |\n| BrainPad | Digital Marketing | Search advertising optimization | Automates advertising optimization |\n| Campify | Camp Management | Camp schedule optimization | Replaces hundreds of manual scheduling hours |\n| Complevo | Bakery Operations | Workforce scheduling optimization | Eliminates scheduling chaos at bakeries |\n| Copenhagen Airport | Aviation | Gate and stand assignment optimization | Maximizes aircraft stand utilization |\n| Copenhagen Airports | Aviation | Check-in counter assignment optimization | Optimizes for 150+ airlines |\n| Delhivery | Logistics | Last-mile delivery route optimization | Fulfills over 1 billion orders with 24/7 efficiency |\n| East Daley Capital | Energy Infrastructure | Midstream asset mapping optimization | Maps oil and gas infrastructure interconnectivity |\n| EasyPark | Urban Parking | Parking guidance optimization | Guides drivers to available spots |\n| Emesa | Marketing | Email campaign optimization | Personalizes campaigns for targeted customers |\n| Eurodecision | Airport Operations | Shift and personnel planning optimization | Aligns staff shifts with flight traffic surges |\n| Hewlett-Packard | Project Management | Portfolio optimization | Reduces waste and accelerates project delivery |\n| ICRON/Vestel | Supply Chain | S&OP integration optimization | Boosts visibility, collaboration, and profitability |\n| Kaneka | Chemical Manufacturing | Production planning optimization | Balances diverse chemical product lines |\n| Kvaerner | Oil & Gas Engineering | Scaffolding modeling optimization | Reduces engineering time for projects |\n| LeanLogistics | Logistics | Freight planning optimization | Optimizes millions of daily orders globally |\n| Lufthansa Flight Training | Aviation Training | Simulator scheduling optimization | Schedules 45 devices across 150+ airlines |\n| Microsoft Research | Research | Computational challenge solving | Tackles complex computational problems at scale |\n| Mondelēz | Consumer Goods | Shipment optimization | Optimizes factory shipments across country |\n| National Football League | Sports | Game scheduling optimization | Schedules 256 games across 17 weeks |\n| Advanced Microgrid Solutions | Energy/Utilities | Local power generation optimization | Cuts customer electric bills |\n| Air France | Aviation | Tail assignment optimization | Saves ~1% on annual fuel costs |\n\n**Note:** The webpage lists 120+ case studies with varying levels of detail. Most entries lack specific variable/constraint counts or runtime data. Industries span energy, logistics, retail, aviation, manufacturing, utilities, finance, and public sector applications."}]},"uuid":"26bc5994-43b5-46e5-924b-133cfdb86eef","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:02:06.110Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"c6712940-6c84-46ad-a9fa-96be9b937340","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
