{"parentUuid":"47bd4e5d-924b-40db-ae80-f083b2244ac3","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a0a1880745aab67e3","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01UYGX4SwVATKBzeCc2KjLRK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01WGNLj2GUtwtV4FeutKTXWw","name":"WebSearch","input":{"query":"\"Pasco Shikishima\" OR \"Bridgestone\" Hexaly LocalSolver case study production planning details"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12581,"cache_read_input_tokens":46061,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":12581,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CaotDrxJzumkyBTVRynjp","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"31da344c-ccf4-4179-90a2-5e4ab34f1ccf","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:02:14.835Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"47bd4e5d-924b-40db-ae80-f083b2244ac3","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"38c07af1-20a0-4259-b86e-62f4b4b0ab0c","agentId":"a0a1880745aab67e3","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FyDv1ehhujNo2eQVq4enA4","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"\"two-stage\" heuristic exact verify large-scale layout placement industrial Benders LBBD CPAIOR\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"(PDF) Stochastic Planning and Scheduling with Logic-Based Benders Decomposition\",\"url\":\"https://www.academia.edu/84106105/Stochastic_Planning_and_Scheduling_with_Logic_Based_Benders_Decomposition\"},{\"title\":\"1 Introduction\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/html/2508.05863\"},{\"title\":\"Stochastic Planning and Scheduling with Logic-Based Benders Decomposition | INFORMS Journal on Computing\",\"url\":\"https://pubsonline.informs.org/doi/10.1287/ijoc.2022.1184\"},{\"title\":\"Risk-aware Logic-based Benders Decomposition for a ...\",\"url\":\"https://optimization-online.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/SLAP-2.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Logic-based Benders decomposition for bi-objective parallel machine selection and job scheduling with release dates and resource consumption - ScienceDirect\",\"url\":\"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/abs/pii/S0305054823003921\"},{\"title\":\"Combinatorial Benders Cuts for Assembly Line Balancing Problems with Setups\",\"url\":\"https://optimization-online.org/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/5397.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Multicut logic‐based Benders decomposition for discrete‐time scheduling and dynamic optimization of network batch plants - Liñán - 2024 - AIChE Journal - Wiley Online Library\",\"url\":\"https://aiche.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aic.18491\"},{\"title\":\"Full article: Optimizing facility layout planning for reconfigurable manufacturing system based on chaos genetic algorithm\",\"url\":\"https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/full/10.1080/21693277.2019.1602486\"},{\"title\":\"Logic-based Benders decomposition methods for the distributed permutation flow shop scheduling problem with production and transportation cost - ScienceDirect\",\"url\":\"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/abs/pii/S0305054825000723\"},{\"title\":\"(PDF) Two-stage heuristic algorithm for the large-scale capacitated location routing problem\",\"url\":\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/292073821_Two-stage_heuristic_algorithm_for_the_large-scale_capacitated_location_routing_problem\"}]\n\nBased on the web search results, I found relevant research on logic-based Benders decomposition (LBBD) and related optimization techniques. Here are the key findings:\n\n## Two-Stage Optimization with LBBD\n\nLogic-based Benders decomposition (LBBD) has been applied to two-stage stochastic planning and scheduling problems in which the second stage is a scheduling task. The master problem is solved with mixed integer/linear programming and the subproblem with constraint programming, using simple no-good cuts as well as analytic logic-based cuts.\n\n## Large-Scale Problem Solving\n\nFor large-scale instances, researchers have proposed easily implementable heuristics that solve a sequence of problems in which restrictions on the schedule are imposed and progressively relaxed. Exact logic-based Benders decomposition algorithms enhanced by acceleration techniques—including preprocessing, master problem strengthening, and efficient cut separation—can achieve speedups of three orders of magnitude.\n\n## Industrial and Facility Layout Applications\n\nThe search results include applications to various industrial problems including two-stage assembly flow-shop scheduling problems and distributed permutation flow shop scheduling problems addressed through logic-based Benders decomposition methods that decompose problems into order assignment master problems and scheduling subproblems.\n\n## CPAIOR Conference Research\n\nA paper by Heinz and Beck at CPAIOR 2012 evaluated whether mixed integer software had become competitive with logic-based Benders decomposition for facility assignment and scheduling problems.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"1c602135-e3c7-4d60-b43e-38cd40ec00ac","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:02:20.342Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"47bd4e5d-924b-40db-ae80-f083b2244ac3","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"31da344c-ccf4-4179-90a2-5e4ab34f1ccf","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"38c07af1-20a0-4259-b86e-62f4b4b0ab0c","agentId":"a0a1880745aab67e3","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WGNLj2GUtwtV4FeutKTXWw","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"\"Pasco Shikishima\" OR \"Bridgestone\" Hexaly LocalSolver case study production planning details\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"How Pasco Shikishima solves a global supply chain problem involving 32 million variables - Hexaly\",\"url\":\"https://www.hexaly.com/customers/pasco-shikishima-global-supply-chain-optimization?redirect\"},{\"title\":\"Two-Stage Modeling Approach for Solving Large-Scale Production Planning MILPs with Hexaly\",\"url\":\"https://www.hexaly.com/customers/bridgestone-solves-large-scale-production-planning-milp-using-hexaly\"},{\"title\":\"How Pasco Shikishima solves a global supply chain problem involving 32 million variables\",\"url\":\"https://www.hexaly.com/customers/pasco-shikishima-global-supply-chain-optimization\"},{\"title\":\"A Comparative Modelling Approach to Improve Large Scale MILP Optimization in Production Planning\",\"url\":\"https://www.hexaly.com/customers/improving-large-scale-milp-production-planning-hexaly\"},{\"title\":\"Customers\",\"url\":\"https://www.hexaly.com/customers?redirect\"},{\"title\":\"Frédéric Gardi on LinkedIn: #localsolver #optimization #operationsresearch\",\"url\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/fredericgardi_localsolver-optimization-operationsresearch-activity-7000835435740422144-cnDQ?trk=public_profile_like_view\"},{\"title\":\"Pasco Case Study - Chrome Enterprise\",\"url\":\"https://chromeenterprise.google/customers/pasco/\"},{\"title\":\"Initiatives for Improving Web Accessibility by Shikishima Baking (Pasco) Started with the Renewal of Their Official Website - Uniweb\",\"url\":\"https://hellouniweb.com/en/case-studies/pasco_interview/\"},{\"title\":\"Case Study 15 : Bridgestone Elastech Co., Ltd | Production Scheduling System | Asprova\",\"url\":\"https://www.asprova.com/en/case-studies/molding/case_study_15_bridgestone_elastech_co_ltd.html\"},{\"title\":\"Solvers for Scheduling and Routing Problems |\",\"url\":\"https://dmcommunity.org/2024/04/16/localsolver-is-now-hexaly/\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here are the key details about the Pasco Shikishima and Bridgestone case studies with Hexaly (formerly LocalSolver):\n\n## Pasco Shikishima - Supply Chain Optimization\n\nPasco Shikishima, a leading Japanese food company ($1.5 billion in annual revenue, 4,000 employees), has chosen Hexaly Optimizer to solve a vast, global supply chain optimization problem.\n\n**Problem Scale:** Pasco's supply chain involves 13 factories in Japan, each one with several production lines, more than 100 supply sites, and 26 delivery hubs. Pasco's catalog contains more than 1,000 products. About 900,000 orders have to be delivered each day in Pasco's factories.\n\n**Results:** This model is solved in 3 minutes of running time on a basic server, including input and output processing times. After weeks of extensive benchmarking against leading commercial MIP solvers (Cplex, Gurobi, Xpress), Hexaly proved to be the sole general-purpose mathematical optimization solver able to deliver high-quality solutions quickly to Pasco's all-Japan supply chain optimization problem.\n\n## Bridgestone - Production Planning\n\nBridgestone operates a large and complex industrial production planning network, manufacturing multiple tire families across several plants. Production planning decisions must balance manufacturing efficiency, service levels, capacity constraints, and inventory targets over a rolling horizon of 4 to 5 months.\n\nHexaly leverages a two-stage modeling approach for solving large-scale production planning MILPs by combining decomposition and global reoptimization.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"95855683-58ca-4024-ada6-278c18ea56e2","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:02:23.369Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"31da344c-ccf4-4179-90a2-5e4ab34f1ccf","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"95855683-58ca-4024-ada6-278c18ea56e2","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a0a1880745aab67e3","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01AZvccZywgn3RvtzZjLvqNU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have ample data now. Let me compile the report.\n\n---\n\n# 工业 OR 会议 / Vendor Case Study 调研 (2024-2026)\n\n## 核心 INFORMS / EURO / CPAIOR 信号\n\n**INFORMS 2024-2025 主会场**：核心议题是网络设计 + 调度 + 运营路由，**不是格点 placement**。Walmart 在 INFORMS 2024 拿了 Edelman，做的是 retail truck routing + load planning（FY2023 节省 $91.5M、3300 万英里），核心方法是 routing 与 variable-sized multi-compartment container loading 联合优化，毫秒级在线决策（[INFORMS Walmart Edelman](https://www.informs.org/News-Room/INFORMS-Releases/Awards-Releases/Operations-Research-Enhances-Retail-Truck-Routing-and-Load-Planning-Walmart-Awarded-the-2023-INFORMS-Edelman-Award)，[期刊文](https://pubsonline.informs.org/doi/10.1287/inte.2023.0093)）。Amazon 的 \"Regionalize and Scale\" 在 IJAA 2025 v55 也是网络设计，没碰格点（[Amazon Regionalize](https://pubsonline.informs.org/doi/10.1287/inte.2025.0295)）。\n\n**CPAIOR 2024 (Uppsala) accepted papers** 里最贴近我们的是 **\"ULD Build-Up Scheduling with Logic-Based Benders Decomposition\"**（Euler/Borndoerfer/Puchert/Takkula，Lufthansa Cargo），用 LBBD 做集装单元堆装，规模在数千 ULD，master 是 MILP、subproblem 是装载可行性 CP（[CPAIOR 2024](https://sites.google.com/view/cpaior2024/accepted-papers)）。还有 Aircraft Disassembly Scheduling（Schaus 组）。**CPAIOR 2025（Melbourne，11月）**已开放但 program 尚未公开 placement 类工业 talk。\n\n**EURO 2025 (Leeds)** 有 \"Making an Impact\" 实践 stream，但当前网页暴露的具体 talk 列表里 placement 类工业案例不显著（[EURO 2025](https://www.gams.com/conferences/2025-06-euro_leeds-uk/)）。\n\n## 求解器 vendor 真实工业案例（按可借鉴度排序）\n\n1. **Pasco Shikishima 全日本面包供应链（Hexaly）**：3200 万变量，13 工厂 + 100 供应点 + 26 hub + 1000 SKU + 90 万日订单，**3 分钟出解**。关键：Cplex/Gurobi/Xpress 都搞不定，Hexaly 因为是 primal heuristics + local search 全局优化器才打通（[Pasco](https://www.hexaly.com/customers/pasco-shikishima-global-supply-chain-optimization)）。借鉴：超大规模时**纯 exact MIP 不工作**，工业上接受 heuristic + 高质量解。\n\n2. **Bridgestone 轮胎产能规划（Hexaly）**：多工厂 × 多 family，4-5 个月滚动。明确用了 **\"two-stage 分解 + 全局再优化\"** 模式——先分解到子问题、再全局 reoptimize（[Bridgestone](https://www.hexaly.com/customers/bridgestone-solves-large-scale-production-planning-milp-using-hexaly)）。这模式跟我们 Benders master→binding→routing→flow 思路一致。\n\n3. **Amazon Data Center VM 分配（Hexaly）**：**2M VMs → 100K servers**，分钟级出解。Bin-packing/assignment 类，规模比我们大三个数量级，但只要\"够好\"，不要求 OPTIMAL（[Hexaly customers](https://www.hexaly.com/customers)）。\n\n4. **Renault PMS 包装物流（Hexaly）**：每年节省数百万欧元，benchmark CPLEX 后选了 Hexaly，**分钟级近似最优**。Renault OR 团队 2016 起持续用，已扩展到生产排程、运输、网络设计、卡车装载、车间布局（[Renault](https://www.hexaly.com/customers/renault-packaging-logistics-optimization)）。\n\n5. **Walmart 运输 + 装车联合优化（Edelman 2023, INFORMS 2024 talk）**：rich constraints 下 routing + variable-sized container loading **毫秒级在线**，节省 $91.5M（[Walmart paper](https://pubsonline.informs.org/doi/10.1287/inte.2023.0093)）。\n\n6. **Solar 电站布局（INFORMS Journal on Computing 2024，Wang/Wu/Pan/Shen）**：district partitioning + PV 部件位置 + 电缆路由的**集成 location-and-routing**，**Benders 变体分解 + branch-and-cut subproblem**，平均 LB-UB gap **0.02%**（[IJOC 2024](https://pubsonline.informs.org/doi/10.1287/ijoc.2023.0223)）。**这是跟我们最像的论文**：网格 + 几何 + 路由 + 集成多层 + Benders。\n\n7. **Industrial-size Job Shop CP-SAT vs CP Optimizer**（Da Col & Teppan，FCS 2022 后续工作）：benchmark 到 **100 万 operations × 1000 machines**，半导体 fab 规模。结论：CP-SAT 在大实例上 catch up 上 CP Optimizer，工业上两者都用（[ScienceDirect](https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S2214716022000215)）。\n\n8. **Toyota 日产排程（Gurobi）**、**Audi 物流（Gurobi 几秒级）**、**Yutong 客车 170+ 日订单 × 10 产线（Gurobi）**：汽车制造日级 production planning，都是 MIP **接受 0.5-2% gap、几秒到几分钟**（[Gurobi case studies](https://www.gurobi.com/case_studies/)）。\n\n9. **Pentair 1300 金属铸模排程（Gurobi）** + **Tata Steel 煤配比（Gurobi）**：复杂 metal manufacturing，规模比我们大、约束更乱，工业上不追求 PROVED OPTIMAL。\n\n10. **Lufthansa Cargo ULD 装载（CPAIOR 2024，LBBD）**：航空集装单元堆装，**MILP master + CP subproblem**，跟我们 master/binding/routing 同一个 LBBD 套路（[CPAIOR 2024](https://sites.google.com/view/cpaior2024/accepted-papers)）。\n\n11. **Air Liquide bulk inventory routing（Hexaly）**：欧洲多国冷冻液配送，分钟级出解，已生产 10+ 年（[Air Liquide](https://www.hexaly.com/customers/air-liquide-inventory-routing)）。\n\n12. **TF1 媒体规划（Hexaly）百万变量**、**Suzano 100+ 国出口物流（Gurobi）**、**Polymathian 矿山-铁路-港集成（Gurobi）**：超大规模工业流，**全部接受 anytime + 非零 gap**。\n\n## 真实工业 vs 学术 benchmark 的关键差距\n\n- **工业项目几乎不要求 PROVED OPTIMAL**：Gurobi 官方文档明确说工业实践 MIPGap 用非零值（0.1%-2%），换计算时间。学术 benchmark 才追 OPTIMAL（[Gurobi MIPGap](https://support.gurobi.com/hc/en-us/articles/8265539575953-What-is-the-MIPGap)）。\n- **工业项目接受 anytime**：Walmart/Amazon/Pasco 都跑 anytime，时间一到就拿当前最好解走。\n- **规模通常是百万-千万变量**，比我们 70×70 + 266 facility 大 1-3 个数量级，但**他们对最优性要求低**——这是 trade-off。\n- **Hexaly 反复打败 CPLEX/Gurobi/Xpress** 在超大规模 MILP 上——因为它是 primal-heuristic-first + local search 全局优化器，不是纯 exact MIP。这是个值得记住的市场信号。\n\n## 对我们项目最有借鉴价值的 3 条\n\n1. **\"两阶段：分解 + 全局 reoptimize\" 是工业标准模式**（Bridgestone、Solar Plant IJOC 2024、Lufthansa ULD 都是）。我们的 Benders master→binding→routing→flow 正好在这条主流上，但工业版本通常还有一个 **\"全局 polishing\"** 收尾阶段（拿到 binding 解之后再做一次小范围全局重排）。我们目前缺这一步——Phase 3B 加速可以考虑加 polishing pass。\n\n2. **Solar Plant 那篇 IJOC 2024（[link](https://pubsonline.informs.org/doi/10.1287/ijoc.2023.0223)）跟我们结构惊人相似**：网格化区域 + 部件 placement + cable routing 集成，Benders 变体 + branch-and-cut subproblem，达到 0.02% gap。**值得精读这篇论文 + GitHub 复现 repo**——很可能他们的 cut 形态、master 强化技巧能直接迁移。\n\n3. **工业项目几乎一致接受 heuristic + 高质量近似解，不追 PROVED OPTIMAL**。我们 PROJECT_LOCK 把 certified_exact 路径锁死是对的（这是项目独特价值），但**应该明确 exact 路径只是 release 用、日常迭代/AI shadow 完全可以用 anytime + 0.5% gap 的 exploratory 路径加速实验**。Hexaly 在大规模 MILP 上反复打败 Gurobi/CPLEX 这个事实也提示：如果某天 70×70 exact 真的扛不住、或要扩到 100×100，可以试 Hexaly 作为 exploratory 加速器（不是 certified 替代）。\n\n## 关键链接\n\n- [Solar Plant Layout, IJOC 2024 (最像我们)](https://pubsonline.informs.org/doi/10.1287/ijoc.2023.0223)\n- [Hexaly 全部客户案例](https://www.hexaly.com/customers)\n- [Pasco Shikishima 32M 变量案例](https://www.hexaly.com/customers/pasco-shikishima-global-supply-chain-optimization)\n- [Bridgestone 两阶段建模案例](https://www.hexaly.com/customers/bridgestone-solves-large-scale-production-planning-milp-using-hexaly)\n- [Walmart Edelman 2023 paper](https://pubsonline.informs.org/doi/10.1287/inte.2023.0093)\n- [Amazon Regionalize, IJAA 2025](https://pubsonline.informs.org/doi/10.1287/inte.2025.0295)\n- [Industrial-size Job Shop CP benchmark](https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S2214716022000215)\n- [CPAIOR 2024 accepted papers](https://sites.google.com/view/cpaior2024/accepted-papers)\n- [CPAIOR 2025](https://sites.google.com/view/cpaior2025)\n- [Gurobi case studies](https://www.gurobi.com/case_studies/)\n- [INFORMS Walmart Edelman release](https://www.informs.org/News-Room/INFORMS-Releases/Awards-Releases/Operations-Research-Enhances-Retail-Truck-Routing-and-Load-Planning-Walmart-Awarded-the-2023-INFORMS-Edelman-Award)"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3103,"cache_read_input_tokens":58642,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3103,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CaotF8k6xroKqyrf3drdw","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"cfe4ba0f-21a7-43c9-94ed-0adaec9c5a2f","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:03:33.534Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
